  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Rinse the trout fillets under cold water and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the dashi-extract, olive oil, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto both sides of the trout fillets, then place them on the preheated grill.",
    "Grill the trout for 8 minutes per side, or until they flake easily with a fork.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the lemon slices on the grill for 1-2 minutes, or until fragrant.",
    "Once the trout is cooked, serve it on a plate with the toasted lemon slices and garnished with parsley and cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
